        rdf:object "Conversational assistants giving business users natural-language access to enterprise data and knowledge, combining NL2SQL over structured data (data warehouses & semantic models, relational databases, governed analytical platforms) and RAG over unstructured knowledge (PDFs, policies, SOPs, documents, presentations, contracts, knowledge repositories)" ;
        rdf:predicate fact:offer-definition ;
        rdf:subject entity:talk-to-data ;
